<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Arizona State University cannot consider your application for a different semester. Therefore, please withdraw your application to ASU and reapply for the semester in which you want to attend the university.</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">To cancel your application, please visit <a href="http://students.asu.edu/canceladmissions">students.asu.edu/canceladmissions</a> or email <a href="mailto:decline@asu.edu">decline@ASU.edu</a>.</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">In the email, please include your full name, date of birth, and the semester from which you wish to withdraw your application. Once your application is withdrawn, you can reapply to ASU for the semester you want to enroll in classes.&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Sincerely,</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial;">Admission Services</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial;">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div></div></div></div></div></div></span></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>